OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785419297
OL,3,CWomen's group withdraw legal challenge
OL,4,Cover cancelled Feile event
OL,6,FIt's been confirmed that a Women's
OL,7,FRights Network event will not go ahead
OL,8,Fas part of Feile an Phobail, despite a
OL,9,Flegal challenge.
OL,11,FThe group had launched proceedings
OL,12,Fafter Feile cancelled their scheduled
OL,13,Fevent due to take place at the
OL,14,Ffestival next month.
OL,16,FAfter negotiations last Friday both
OL,17,Fparties failed to resolve the issue
OL,18,Fand the WRN issued legal proceedings.
OL,26,@lD@QrrpD@MrrtD@Hrr
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785419297
OL,3,CWomen's group withdraw legal challenge
OL,4,Cover cancelled Feile event
OL,6,FHowever following a brief hearing at
OL,7,Fthe High Court on Wednesday morning it
OL,8,Fwas disclosed that an agreement had
OL,9,Fbeen reached between both sides to
OL,10,Fdiscontinue the action.
OL,12,FIn a statement, the Women's Rights
OL,13,FNetwork welcomed Feile's agreement to
OL,14,Fmeet with them to explore
OL,15,Fparticipation in future events.
OL,17,FThe Judge said both parties deserved
OL,18,Fcredit for reaching a resolution.
OL,26,@lD@QrruD@Srr
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/9
