OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785419297
OL,3,CWomen's group withdraw legal challenge
OL,4,Cover cancelled Feile event
OL,6,FRepresentatives of Feile Phobail spoke
OL,7,Foutside the High Court after the
OL,8,Fhearing ended.
OL,10,FKevin Gamble, Director of Feile an
OL,11,FPhobail Feile said: "An Phobail is
OL,12,Fdelighted with today's outcome in the
OL,13,FHigh Court.
OL,15,F"Today's outcome is a vindication of
OL,16,FFeile's position in standing up for
OL,17,Fthose who are marginalised.
OL,19,F"Feile's decision to withdraw this
OL,20,Fevent from our programme stands.
OL,26,@lD@QrrrD@\rrsD@JrrxD@Brr{D@Crr
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785419297
OL,3,CWomen's group withdraw legal challenge
OL,4,Cover cancelled Feile event
OL,6,F"The agenda of many of those who
OL,7,Finvolved themselves in this issue was
OL,8,Fclear for all to see.
OL,10,F"Many of the very same people lining
OL,11,Fup year after year to attack Feile at
OL,12,Fevery turn ` to attempt to damage
OL,13,FFeile, and an attempt to attack the
OL,14,FWest Belfast community.
OL,16,F"They will never succeed. Feile an
OL,17,FPhobail will continue to provide a
OL,18,Fvoice for the marginalised, and we are
OL,19,Flooking forward to welcoming the world
OL,20,Fto West Belfast to celebrate Ireland's
OL,21,Fbiggest community arts festival."
OL,26,@lD@QrrsD@_rruD@BrrxD@\rr
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/9
