OL,3,CWomen's group withdraw legal challenge
OL,4,Cover cancelled Feile event
OL,6,FIn a statement the Women's Rights
OL,7,FNetwork said it was delighted to have
OL,8,Freached agreement with Feile an
OL,9,FPhobail.
OL,11,F"WRN NI is delighted to have reached
OL,12,Fan agreement with Feile an Phobail
OL,13,Fwhich brings the current legal
OL,14,Fproceedings to an end.
OL,16,F"The Judge congratulated the parties
OL,17,Ftoday, saying they both deserved
OL,18,Fcredit for reaching a resolution in
OL,19,Fthis difficult domain involving
OL,20,Femotive issues.
OL,26,@lD@QrrpD@YrrtD@Trr
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/9
