CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785419297
OL,3,CWomen's group withdraw legal challenge
OL,4,Cover cancelled Feile event
OL,6,F"Feile has agreed to meet with WRN NI
OL,7,Fto explore and discuss our potential
OL,8,Fparticipation in future Feile events,
OL,9,Fand we warmly welcome the opportunity
OL,10,Ffor continued engagement.
OL,12,F"Our women live, work, volunteer and
OL,13,Fsupport their communities across
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland. Our priority has
OL,15,Falways been to bring conversations
OL,16,Fabout women's sex-based rights into
OL,17,Four festivals, workplaces, homes and
OL,18,Fcommunities, and to create spaces
OL,19,Fwhere women can come together and
OL,20,Fdiscuss the rights that affect their
OL,21,Flives.
OL,26,@lD@QrrnD@CrrpD@Zrr
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
