FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785419297
OL,3,CWomen's group withdraw legal challenge
OL,4,Cover cancelled Feile event
OL,6,F"We have done that, and we are
OL,7,Fimmensely grateful for the support we
OL,8,Fhave received over the past week, both
OL,9,Fpublicly and privately. We hope this
OL,10,Fagreement marks the beginning of
OL,11,Fconstructive engagement and greater
OL,12,Fopportunities for women's voices and
OL,13,Fperspectives to be heard.
OL,26,@lD@Qrr
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/9
