PN,41508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785419297
OL,3,CWomen's group withdraw legal challenge
OL,4,Cover cancelled Feile event
OL,6,F"Our work continues. We look forward
OL,7,Fto the Equality Commission for
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland (ECNI) Judicial
OL,9,FReview later this year, where WRN NI
OL,10,Fwill continue advocating for women's
OL,11,Fsex-based rights and for the safety,
OL,12,Fprivacy and dignity of women and girls
OL,13,Facross Northern Ireland.
OL,15,F"And importantly, Respect, Rights &
OL,16,FReality will still go ahead on 4
OL,17,FAugust at an alternative venue.
OL,18,FFurther details will follow. We look
OL,19,Fforward to seeing you there."
OL,26,@lD@Qrr
